      ['locked', 'A <strong>locked model</strong>, exclusive to you, reused at no extra cost.'],
      ['every', `The same face across <strong>a whole order</strong> &mdash; and you choose per order which face runs, one of yours or one of the ${rosterWoord('en')}.`],
